      q('Constructors','Why does this class fail to compile?',['Parent must be final','Child constructors must return void','Child implicitly calls an unavailable Parent()','Private fields are required'],2,'With no explicit constructor invocation, Child() invokes super(). Parent provides only Parent(int).','class Parent { Parent(int value) {} }\nclass Child extends Parent { Child() {} }')
