      q('Concatenation','What is printed?',['3x34','12x7','3x7','12x34'],0,'The first addition is numeric. Once a String is reached, subsequent + operations concatenate left to right.','System.out.println(1 + 2 + "x" + 3 + 4);'),
      q('Compound assignment','Which line compiles when x is a byte?',['x = x + 1;','x = 200;','x += 1;','x = 1.0;'],2,'Compound assignment includes an implicit cast back to the left operand’s type; ordinary addition promotes byte to int.','byte x = 1;'),
      q('Text blocks','Which statement about a Java text block is correct?',['It creates a StringBuilder','Its value is a String','It disables all escape sequences','It requires preview features in Java 21'],1,'A text block is a String literal form, finalized before Java 21. Escape sequences and indentation processing still apply.')
