      q('Daylight saving','Can one calendar day in a regional time zone span a duration other than 24 hours?',['No, all dates have exactly 24 elapsed hours','Yes, daylight-saving transitions can change the elapsed duration','Only with LocalDate, not ZonedDateTime','Only for UTC'],1,'Regional offset transitions can make a local calendar day shorter or longer. Date-based and elapsed-time arithmetic therefore serve different purposes.')
